  description: The researchers need samples of the ground to research the origins of the earthquake.
  giveMessage: We received the data from the weather station. But we need more data to figure out the source of the earthquake. Can you collect soil samples for us?
  completeMessage: Thank you for the samples! It seems like there is radioactive material present in the soil. We don't think that this was an earthquake of natural origins. You should go to the desert to investigate further. We contacted some people there, and the zoning restrictions are lifted!
